OL,3,GNEWSASisters of murdered six-year-old  
OL,4,Ato meet ministers                      
OL,6,FThe family of a six-year-old girl      
OL,7,Fmurdered on her way to school more than
OL,8,F40 years ago are to meet with ministers
OL,9,Fin a bid to change the law around      
OL,10,Fviolent sexual offenders.              
OL,12,FCollette Gallacher was raped and       
OL,13,Fstrangled by Adam Stein in Corby,      
OL,14,FNorthamptonshire, on 28 February 1986. 
OL,16,FHer sisters have been campaigning for  
OL,17,Fnew laws to prevent offenders changing 
OL,18,Ftheir names and to allow them to be    
OL,19,Fadded to the sex offenders register    
OL,20,Fretroactively.                         
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
