OL,3,GNEWSASisters of murdered six-year-old  
OL,4,Ato meet ministers                      
OL,6,FThe Labour MP for Corby, Lee Barron,   
OL,7,Ftold the Commons: "The family will not 
OL,8,Fbe advised of the name change as the   
OL,9,Fpresumption is not to inform them in   
OL,10,Forder to protect the rights of the     
OL,11,Fmurderer."                             
